# Copy this file to `local.properties` (which is git-ignored) and fill in the
# values below. See the "Building from source" section of README.md for how
# to register a MyAnimeList API client.

## Location of the Android SDK. Android Studio fills this in automatically the
## first time you open the project — you usually don't need to set it by hand.
# sdk.dir=/path/to/Android/Sdk

## Your MyAnimeList API client ID (from https://myanimelist.net/apiconfig).
## Register the app's redirect URI there as exactly: mochi://oauth/callback
## Do NOT put a client secret here — Mochi is a public client using PKCE and
## only needs the client ID.
MAL_CLIENT_ID=
